      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchishinji chajesi mwakamena mutombu, mutayi wakunyijiyindi wakasoŋa nyikabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaYehova wakashakama hadiyena, spiritu wamaana niwakashinshi, spiritu wakuleja maana niwaŋovu, spiritu wakwiluka wakutiya Yehova woma; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chuma chakatiyayi kuwahayowu kumutiya Yehova woma; hakasompesha chakumona kwanamesuhohuku; hakahoshela chakutiya kwanamatu hohuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakasompesha atuzweŋa mwaloŋa, adizoza mwituŋa wakayihoshela mwoloka. Waketaituŋa namutondu wakanwa kindi, wakajaha akwakwila yatama namuuya wakunyivumbu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuloŋa kwakekala mukwatu wakumayindi, kashinshi kakekala mukwatu wakukasa mwivumu dindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋwidi wakashakamaŋa hamu namwana kamukoku, chisumpa wakakamaŋahamu namwana kampembi; ni mwana kaŋombi nimwenzi wamutupa nichimuna wakudiisha chachiwahi akekalaŋa hamu; akayilombolaŋa akudi mwana wanyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimukaji waŋombi nibera akadiilaŋa hamu; anyanawu akakamaŋa hamu; mutupa wakadyaloŋa nsaachi jatidiku neyi ŋombi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu muji wajesi wakemana kulonda kwikala mpandeluyanyuza yawantu, kudi yena diku kwakahwila nyuza, hawunookelu windihakekala halema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu Mwanta wakakwata cheŋa kamuchiyedi chikasa chindikumudimu wakulanda chibalu chawantu indi anashaluku, nikuAshuri, nikuEjipitu, nikuPatirosi, nikuKushi, nikuElami, nikuShinari, nikuHamati, nikuyitutu yakukaluŋilwiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza wakayimikila mpandelu, wakapompesha aIsarela apwapuka, wakakuŋula aYuda anamwaŋa ali, kunsa jesekŋiwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichima daEfweremi dakafuma, amweshaŋa aYuda kukala akayifumishahu; Efweremi hakatiyila nawa cheŋa Yuda ichimaku, Yuda hakamwesha nawa cheŋi Efweremi kukalaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatuntama hamafwijia waFwilistinu kumuji ka; akabuwila hamu antu akumusela; akolola makasawu akakwati aEdomi naMowabi; anyana kaAmoni akayovwahila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakakisaŋana chikupu mukotu wakaluŋalwiji kakuEjipitu; wakazwiya chikasa kuKaloŋa nampepela yindi yababaŋa neyi kesi, wakaketa, kakabalumuka tuloŋa tutanu natuyedi, wakazambwisha antu kunyenduyawu saŋa komina chau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakekala mukwakwa wakufuma kuAshuri wachibalu chawantu indi akashalaku; neyi cheliliyi nawaIsarela ifuku dafuminuwu mwituŋa daEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
